{"id": "d2-nb-001", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रुक्मिणी का बच्चा, तीसरा दिन है आज। वजन पौने दो किलो, दूध ठीक पी रहा है, नाभि साफ़ है, कोई मवाद नहीं।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rukmini", "day": 3, "weight_g": 1750, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": false}}, "flags": ["nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "numbers-in-words", "negation"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-002", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अरे दीदी, ये शबनम वाला बच्चा... सांस गिनी तो इकसठ आई एक मिनट में, पसली नहीं चल रही, बाकी दूध खूब पी रहा है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shabnam", "resp_rate": 61, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": false}}, "flags": ["nb_fast_breathing"], "tags": ["filler", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "local-idiom"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-003", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बच्चा सातवें दिन का है, तापमान सैंतीस दशमलव चार, दूध अच्छे से पी रहा, पीलिया नहीं, झटके भी नहीं आए।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 7, "temp_c": 37.4, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "convulsions": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["no-name", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "normal-visit", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-004", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "ज्योति का बेटा पहले दिन का है, आँखें पीली दिख रही हैं, पर हथेली और तलवे पीले नहीं, दूध ठीक से पी रहा।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Jyoti", "day": 1, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true, "jaundice_palms_soles": false}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_early"], "tags": ["borderline", "negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-005", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बुखार नहीं है, ठंडा भी नहीं लगता, वजन दो किलो चार सौ नब्बे ग्राम, लता का बच्चा, चौदहवां दिन।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Lata", "day": 14, "weight_g": 2490, "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false, "cold_to_touch": false}}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["borderline", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-006", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "मीना के बच्चे को आज दो बार झटके आए, अब सुस्त पड़ा है, छूने पर ही हिलता है, और दूध भी बिल्कुल नहीं पी रहा।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Meena", "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"convulsions": true, "lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions", "nb_lethargy", "nb_not_feeding"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "distractor-number", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-007", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "थर्मामीटर में निन्यानबे डिग्री आया, बच्चा नौ दिन का है, आजकल दूध कम पीता है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 9, "temp_c": 37.2, "feeding": "poor"}, "flags": ["nb_poor_feeding"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "no-name", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-008", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सविता को खुद थोड़ा बुखार है, बच्चे को नहीं। बच्चा अट्ठाईसवें दिन का, वजन तीन किलो सौ ग्राम, दूध बढ़िया पी रहा, दाने नहीं, दस्त नहीं।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Savita", "day": 28, "weight_g": 3100, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false, "skin_pustules": false, "diarrhoea": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["subject-ambiguity", "normal-visit", "numbers-in-words", "negation"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-009", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "वजन डेढ़ किलो... नहीं नहीं, एक किलो नौ सौ, गलती हो गई। पूजा का बच्चा है, पांचवां दिन, छूने पर बदन ठंडा लग रहा है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Pooja", "day": 5, "weight_g": 1900, "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["self-correction", "fraction-words", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-010", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बच्चे की टट्टी में कल से खून आ रहा है। माँ का नाम कमला, बच्चा दस दिन का।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kamla", "day": 10, "symptoms": {"blood_stool": true}}, "flags": ["nb_blood_stool"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-011", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "नसरीन का बच्चा है, बयालीसवां दिन, वजन चार किलो, दूध पूरा पी रहा, उल्टी नहीं करता, रोना भी जोर का है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Nasreen", "day": 42, "weight_g": 4000, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"vomiting": false, "weak_cry": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal-visit", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "local-idiom"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-012", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तापमान पैंतीस दशमलव पाँच, सांस साठ गिनी, बच्चा चौथे दिन का है, सुरेखा की बेटी है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Surekha", "day": 4, "temp_c": 35.5, "resp_rate": 60}, "flags": [], "tags": ["borderline", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-013", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "दीदी, बच्चे की आँख से कीचड़ आ रहा है और नाभि के पास लाली है, थोड़ा मवाद भी। फूलवती का लड़का, ग्यारह दिन का।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Phoolwati", "day": 11, "symptoms": {"eye_discharge": true, "cord_pus": true}}, "flags": ["nb_cord_infection"], "tags": ["watch-only", "multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words", "filler"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-014", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Haan toh Rehana ka baby, aaj chhatha din, weight 2 kilo 500 gram, doodh theek pee raha, bukhar nahi hai.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rehana", "day": 6, "weight_g": 2500, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal-visit", "borderline", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "filler"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-015", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "baccha bilkul dheela pad gaya hai, rona bhi kamzor hai, doodh pakad hi nahi raha, teesra din hai", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 3, "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"lethargy": true, "weak_cry": true}}, "flags": ["nb_lethargy", "nb_not_feeding"], "tags": ["no-name", "multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-016", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Saira ke bachhe ki pasli chal rahi hai, saans gini to 72 aayi, temperature 38.2", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Saira", "resp_rate": 72, "temp_c": 38.2, "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing", "nb_fever"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "multi-sign", "numbers-digits", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-017", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "aath din ka hai, wajan sawa do kilo, chhoone mein badan garam lag raha hai, Guddi ka bachha", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Guddi", "day": 8, "weight_g": 2250, "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_fever", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign", "no-number-fever"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-018", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Anjali ke bete ki hatheli aur talwe peele hain, aankhen bhi peeli, aaj paanchva din", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Anjali", "day": 5, "symptoms": {"jaundice": true, "jaundice_palms_soles": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_palms"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-019", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "वैशालीचं बाळ आज सातव्या दिवशी, वजन पावणे तीन किलो, दूध व्यवस्थित पितं, ताप नाही.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Vaishali", "day": 7, "weight_g": 2750, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["fraction-words", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-020", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळाला सकाळी आकडी आली, झटके येतात, आता बाळ सुस्त आहे, उषाचं बाळ, दुसरा दिवस.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Usha", "day": 2, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true, "lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions", "nb_lethargy"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-021", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळाचा श्वास मिनिटाला बासष्ट, छाती आत ओढली जाते, दूध कमी पितं.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "resp_rate": 62, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing", "nb_poor_feeding"], "tags": ["no-name", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-022", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सारिकाच्या बाळाचं वजन दीड किलो, तिसरा दिवस, अंग थंड लागतं, दूध पीत नाही.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sarika", "day": 3, "weight_g": 1500, "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_not_feeding", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-023", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "चौदावा दिवस, बाळ छान आहे, दूध पितं, वजन तीन किलो दोनशे, कावीळ नाही, नाळेला पू नाही.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 14, "weight_g": 3200, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "cord_pus": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["no-name", "negation", "normal-visit", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-024", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "भाग्यश्रीचं बाळ, तापमान छत्तीस पॉइंट आठ, श्वास पन्नास, अंगावर पुरळ आलंय, पू भरलेले फोड आहेत.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Bhagyashree", "temp_c": 36.8, "resp_rate": 50, "symptoms": {"skin_pustules": true}}, "flags": ["nb_skin_pustules"], "tags": ["watch-only", "numbers-in-words", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-025", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तापमान 37.5°, बाळ दहा दिवसांचं, उलटी नाही, जुलाब नाही, मंगलचं बाळ.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Mangal", "day": 10, "temp_c": 37.5, "symptoms": {"vomiting": false, "diarrhoea": false}}, "flags": ["nb_fever"], "tags": ["borderline", "stt-style", "numbers-digits", "celsius", "negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-026", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "उज्ज्वलाचं बाळ एकवीस दिवसांचं, वजन एक किलो आठशे ग्रॅम, दूध नीट पितं, बाकी काही त्रास नाही.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Ujwala", "day": 21, "weight_g": 1800, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["borderline", "watch-only", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-027", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पहिला दिवस, बाळाचे डोळे पिवळे दिसत नाहीत, तळवे पण पिवळे नाहीत, शीतलचं बाळ, दूध पितंय.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shital", "day": 1, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "jaundice_palms_soles": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "borderline"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-028", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Sonalicha bal, paachva divas, vajan adich kilo, dudh kami pita, taap nahi", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sonali", "day": 5, "weight_g": 2500, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": ["nb_poor_feeding"], "tags": ["watch-only", "fraction-words", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "negation"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-029", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "balacha shwas 58, tapman 36.9, sagla normal ahe, dudh vyavasthit pita, Rohinicha bal, nava divas", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rohini", "day": 9, "resp_rate": 58, "temp_c": 36.9, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-030", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Komal, day four, weight one point six kilos, feeding okay, no fever, no fits.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Komal", "day": 4, "weight_g": 1600, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false, "convulsions": false}}, "flags": ["nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-031", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Temperature ninety five point five Fahrenheit, the baby feels cold and moves only when we touch him, day two.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 2, "temp_c": 35.3, "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true, "lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_lethargy"], "tags": ["no-name", "fahrenheit", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-032", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Respiratory rate 60 per minute, I counted again, still 60. Day 12, feeding well, cord is clean and dry, Archana's baby.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Archana", "day": 12, "resp_rate": 60, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["borderline", "numbers-digits", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-033", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "This is Swati's daughter, three weeks... sorry, day 20 today, weight 2.3 kg, vomits a little after feeds but feeding is good.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Swati", "day": 20, "weight_g": 2300, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"vomiting": true}}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["self-correction", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-034", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby ka weight 1.79 kg hai, day 6, feeding poor hai, mother Priyanka", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Priyanka", "day": 6, "weight_g": 1790, "feeding": "poor"}, "flags": ["nb_poor_feeding", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["code-mix", "borderline", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-035", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "दिपालीचं बाळ, day 3, temperature 96 degree, अंग थंड नाही, feeding good आहे.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Dipali", "day": 3, "temp_c": 35.6, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["code-mix", "fahrenheit", "borderline", "negation", "numbers-digits", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-nb-036", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Ma'am, Champa ka baby hai, loose motion ho raha hai aur stool mein blood bhi aaya, temp 37.9, day 15", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Champa", "day": 15, "temp_c": 37.9, "symptoms": {"diarrhoea": true, "blood_stool": true}}, "flags": ["nb_blood_stool", "nb_fever"], "tags": ["code-mix", "multi-sign", "numbers-digits", "filler", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-001", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सरिता, सातवां महीना, बीपी एक सौ चालीस बटा नब्बे, एल्बुमिन नहीं आया, खून सवा... नहीं, साढ़े दस है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sarita", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 140, "bp_dia": 90, "albumin": "nil", "hb": 10.5}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension", "anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["months-not-weeks", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "fraction-words", "self-correction", "local-idiom", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-002", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बत्तीस हफ्ते, बीपी एक सौ उनतालीस बटा नवासी, हीमोग्लोबिन ग्यारह, बच्चा ठीक हिल रहा है, बस पैरों में थोड़ी सूजन है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "weeks": 32, "bp_sys": 139, "bp_dia": 89, "hb": 11, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"swelling_feet": true}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["no-name", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-003", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "गीता को बहुत तेज़ सिरदर्द है, धुंधला दिखता है, बीपी 150/100, नौवां महीना चल रहा।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Geeta", "month": 9, "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 100, "symptoms": {"severe_headache": true, "blurred_vision": true}}, "flags": ["anc_headache_vision", "anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "stt-style", "numbers-digits", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-004", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "हीमोग्लोबिन छह दशमलव नौ, थोड़ा चलने पर भी सांस फूलती है, चक्कर आते हैं, बबीता, छत्तीस हफ्ते।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Babita", "weeks": 36, "hb": 6.9, "symptoms": {"breathless": true, "dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_breathless", "anc_severe_anaemia"], "tags": ["borderline", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-005", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुबह पानी की थैली फट गई, दर्द अभी नहीं है, कुसुम, अड़तीस हफ्ते।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kusum", "weeks": 38, "symptoms": {"leaking_fluid": true, "abdominal_pain": false}}, "flags": ["anc_leaking"], "tags": ["negation", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-006", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बीपी डेढ़ सौ पर एक सौ बारह, चेहरे पर और हाथों पर सूजन, एल्बुमिन तीन प्लस, राधा।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Radha", "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 112, "albumin": "3", "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": true}}, "flags": ["anc_imminent_eclampsia", "anc_preeclampsia", "anc_swelling"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-007", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अनीता का छठा महीना, तीसरा बच्चा है, वजन बावन किलो, आयरन की तीस गोली दीं, बीपी एक सौ दस बटा सत्तर, सब ठीक है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Anita", "month": 6, "weight_kg": 52, "ifa_tablets": 30, "bp_sys": 110, "bp_dia": 70}, "flags": [], "tags": ["months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "distractor-number"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-008", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बच्चा कल से हिला ही नहीं, सुमन आठवें महीने में है, बुखार भी नहीं, खून भी नहीं गया।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Suman", "month": 8, "fetal_movement": "absent", "symptoms": {"fever": false, "bleeding": false}}, "flags": ["anc_fetal_movement"], "tags": ["negation", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-009", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "हीमोग्लोबिन सात, एल्बुमिन ट्रेस, बीपी एक सौ बीस बटा अस्सी, पेशाब में जलन है, शोभा, चौबीस हफ्ते।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Shobha", "weeks": 24, "hb": 7, "albumin": "trace", "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": true}}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["watch-only", "borderline", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-010", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पांचवां महीना, निर्मला, उल्टी बहुत हो रही है, कुछ पेट में टिकता ही नहीं, बीपी ठीक है, खून ग्यारह पॉइंट दो।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Nirmala", "month": 5, "hb": 11.2, "symptoms": {"vomiting": true}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "local-idiom"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-011", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Haan ji, Farzana, 28 hafte, BP one forty by ninety two, albumin 2 plus", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Farzana", "weeks": 28, "bp_sys": 140, "bp_dia": 92, "albumin": "2"}, "flags": ["anc_preeclampsia"], "tags": ["numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "filler"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-012", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Hb nau point nau, thodi kamzori hai, aankhon ke aage andhera aata hai, Munni, aathva mahina", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Munni", "month": 8, "hb": 9.9, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["borderline", "watch-only", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "local-idiom"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-013", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "pet mein bahut tez dard ho raha hai aur neeche se khoon bhi aa raha, 34 hafte, Rinki", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rinki", "weeks": 34, "symptoms": {"abdominal_pain": true, "bleeding": true}}, "flags": ["anc_abdominal_pain", "anc_bleeding"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-014", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "BP 130 by 85, Hb 12, baccha theek hil raha, sujan kahin bhi nahi, nauva mahina hai Laxmi ka", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Laxmi", "month": 9, "bp_sys": 130, "bp_dia": 85, "hb": 12, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": false, "swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "months-not-weeks", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-015", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुवर्णा, आठवा महिना, बीपी एकशे साठ बाय एकशे दहा, अल्ब्युमिन एक प्लस, डोकं खूप दुखतं.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Suvarna", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 160, "bp_dia": 110, "albumin": "1", "symptoms": {"severe_headache": true}}, "flags": ["anc_headache_vision", "anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["borderline", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-016", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "हिमोग्लोबिन साडेनऊ, वजन पंचेचाळीस किलो, लोहाच्या शंभर गोळ्या दिल्या, सव्वीस आठवडे, मनीषा.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Manisha", "weeks": 26, "hb": 9.5, "weight_kg": 45, "ifa_tablets": 100}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["watch-only", "fraction-words", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-017", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पाणी जातंय, बाळाची हालचाल कमी झाली, ताप पण आहे, छाया, नववा महिना.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Chhaya", "month": 9, "fetal_movement": "reduced", "symptoms": {"leaking_fluid": true, "fever": true}}, "flags": ["anc_fetal_movement", "anc_fever", "anc_leaking"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "no-number-fever"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-018", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बीपी एकशे वीस बाय ऐंशी, हिमोग्लोबिन दहा, बाळ नीट हलतंय, कुठेही सूज नाही, वजन अठ्ठावन्न किलो, तीस आठवडे.", "record": {"type": "anc", "weeks": 30, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "hb": 10, "fetal_movement": "normal", "weight_kg": 58, "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": false, "swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": ["anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["watch-only", "borderline", "no-name", "negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-019", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अश्विनीला काल रात्री झटके आले, आता शुद्धीवर आहे, बीपी दीडशे बाय शंभर.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Ashwini", "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 100, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["anc_convulsions", "anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-020", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सातवा महिना, सगळं ठीक आहे, बीपी सव्वाशे बाय ऐंशी, ताप नाही, रक्तस्राव नाही, पायाला सूज नाही, कल्पना.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kalpana", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 125, "bp_dia": 80, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "bleeding": false, "swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "months-not-weeks", "normal-visit", "numbers-in-words", "fraction-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-021", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अंगावर सूज आलीय, चेहरा सुजलाय, दम लागतो, एकतीस आठवडे, प्राजक्ता, हिमोग्लोबिन आठ पॉइंट दोन.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Prajakta", "weeks": 31, "hb": 8.2, "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": true, "breathless": true}}, "flags": ["anc_breathless", "anc_moderate_anaemia", "anc_swelling"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-022", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Rupali, chauthya mahinyat, BP 100 by 60, Hb 10.9, chakkar yetat kadhi kadhi", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rupali", "month": 4, "bp_sys": 100, "bp_dia": 60, "hb": 10.9, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["borderline", "watch-only", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-023", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Thirty-five weeks, BP one fifty over one twelve... wait, one fifty over one oh two. Albumin nil. Name Jyotsna.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Jyotsna", "weeks": 35, "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 102, "albumin": "nil"}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["self-correction", "numbers-in-words", "filler"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-024", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Hemlata, 20 weeks, everything fine, no bleeding, no fever, baby movements normal, Hb 11.5, weight 49 kilos.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Hemlata", "weeks": 20, "hb": 11.5, "weight_kg": 49, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "fever": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-digits", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-025", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "BP check kiya, 145 by 88 aaya, albumin nahi, Hb 10.2, Yamuna, ninth month", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Yamuna", "month": 9, "bp_sys": 145, "bp_dia": 88, "albumin": "nil", "hb": 10.2}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension", "anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["code-mix", "numbers-digits", "months-not-weeks", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-026", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "Pregnancy चा आठवा महिना, BP 138/88 आहे, Hb 11, सरस्वती.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Saraswati", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 138, "bp_dia": 88, "hb": 11}, "flags": [], "tags": ["code-mix", "stt-style", "numbers-digits", "borderline", "months-not-weeks", "normal-visit", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-027", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Hb 6.8 hai, bahut weakness hai, breathing problem nahi, 33 weeks, Pinki", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Pinki", "weeks": 33, "hb": 6.8, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true, "breathless": false}}, "flags": ["anc_severe_anaemia"], "tags": ["code-mix", "numbers-digits", "negation"]}
{"id": "d2-anc-028", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "आज visit की, बीपी normal था 118/76, हीमोग्लोबिन बारह, IFA की साठ गोलियां दीं, बच्चा अच्छे से हिल रहा, उनतीस हफ्ते, रजनी", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rajni", "weeks": 29, "bp_sys": 118, "bp_dia": 76, "hb": 12, "ifa_tablets": 60, "fetal_movement": "normal"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["code-mix", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "stt-style"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-001", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "डिलीवरी को तीन दिन हुए, दिन में चार पैड बदल रही है, बुखार नहीं, पेट में दर्द भी नहीं, विमला।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Vimla", "day": 3, "pads": 4, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "abdominal_pain": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["borderline", "negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-002", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "आज चार पैड... नहीं, पाँच पैड भीग गए, बहुत खून जा रहा है, चक्कर आ रहे हैं, सोनी, दूसरा दिन।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Soni", "day": 2, "pads": 5, "symptoms": {"heavy_bleeding": true, "dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_heavy_bleeding"], "tags": ["borderline", "self-correction", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-003", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बुखार एक सौ दो, डिलीवरी को सात दिन हो गए, नीचे से बदबूदार पानी आ रहा है, संगीता।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sangita", "day": 7, "temp_c": 38.9, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_infection"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-004", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पारो की डिलीवरी को पाँच दिन, बोलते-बोलते अटक रही है, उल्टी-सीधी बातें कर रही है, आँखों से धुंधला दिखता है।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Paro", "day": 5, "symptoms": {"abnormal_speech": true, "blurred_vision": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_neuro"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-005", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बारहवां दिन है, स्तन में गांठ और दर्द, दूध ठीक से नहीं उतर रहा, तापमान सैंतीस दशमलव चार।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "day": 12, "temp_c": 37.4, "symptoms": {"breast_problem": true}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["no-name", "borderline", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-006", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Bimla bai, delivery ke baad das din, taap 100.4, neeche se badboo wala discharge aa raha", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Bimla", "day": 10, "temp_c": 38.0, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_infection"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-007", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "raat do baje se saans phool rahi hai, seene mein dard bhi, delivery ka pehla din hai, Rani", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Rani", "day": 1, "symptoms": {"breathless": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_breathless"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "distractor-number"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-008", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Sushila, chautha din, pads teen badle, na bukhar hai na peshab mein jalan, sab theek", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sushila", "day": 4, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-009", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळंतपणाला सहा दिवस झाले, खूप ताप आहे, अंग गरम, थंडी वाजते, सुनंदा.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sunanda", "day": 6, "symptoms": {"fever": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_fever"], "tags": ["watch-only", "no-number-fever", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-010", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तापमान अडतीस पॉइंट नऊ, पांढरं पाणी जातंय पण वास नाही, तिसरा दिवस, रेखा.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Rekha", "day": 3, "temp_c": 38.9, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_fever"], "tags": ["watch-only", "borderline", "negation", "numbers-in-words", "celsius"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-011", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "आज फिट आली, झटके आले, बोलणं पण बदललंय, आठवा दिवस, मंदा.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Manda", "day": 8, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true, "abnormal_speech": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_convulsions", "pnc_neuro"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-012", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "दिवसाला तीन पॅड, ताप नाही, स्तन ठीक आहेत, चेहऱ्यावर सूज नाही, बाळ पण छान दूध पितं, पंधरावा दिवस, सुमित्रा.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sumitra", "day": 15, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "breast_problem": false, "swelling_face_hands": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "subject-ambiguity"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-013", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Savitri, bara divas, taap 39 degree, pot khup dukhta", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Savitri", "day": 12, "temp_c": 39.0, "symptoms": {"abdominal_pain": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_high_fever"], "tags": ["celsius", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "borderline"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-014", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Day nine after delivery, temperature ninety nine point five, no foul smell, changing two pads a day. Mother is Asma.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Asma", "day": 9, "temp_c": 37.5, "pads": 2, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_fever"], "tags": ["watch-only", "borderline", "fahrenheit", "negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-015", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Tabassum, fourth day, no fever, no heavy bleeding, breasts are fine, eating well, three pads.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Tabassum", "day": 4, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "heavy_bleeding": false, "breast_problem": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "d2-pnc-016", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "Delivery के बाद twenty days, temperature 37.8°, बदबू वाला discharge है, रुखसार", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Ruksar", "day": 20, "temp_c": 37.8, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_fever"], "tags": ["watch-only", "borderline", "code-mix", "numbers-digits", "numbers-in-words", "celsius", "stt-style"]}
